 { Miljkovic – Zontakh, Serbia (var) 2011 } { _ } 25. d6 $1 { This intriguing position would have given White a shot at immortality, had it occurred in the game. White wins with a fine combination. } ( 25. Bd8 Rxd8 26. Qg5 Kh8 27. Qxd8 Ndf6 { does not work. Black is in full control and has an extra piece. } ) 
